[react-components.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/react-components.mdc) - Common React component rules

- React components live in `astro-app/src/components` folder
- Use existing shadcn/ui components where possible from `astro-app/src/components/ui`
- If more shadcn components are needed, use the command `pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add component-name` (run from the `astro-app` directory)
- Use `client:*` directives strategically:
  - `client:load` - For immediately needed interactivity
  - `client:idle` - For non-critical UI components
  - `client:visible` - For below-the-fold interactive components
- Import types from `@/lib/definitions` for shared data types (from `astro-app/src/lib/definitions.ts`)
